# Stamp/print tests

Shape claims load the stamp (`commands.yaml`, enums) or generated types and
walk every current print. `lw check schema` is the census of handlers vs
stamp. Do not copy the command list into a test array.

Behaviour claims (handler tables, httptest) may use fixtures. Stamp:
`lightwave://schemas/policy/testing/test_contract` (`stamp_bound`, `print_census`).
